{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2022-02-07 10:02:00', 'title': 'EPAM CELEBRATES 10-YEAR ANNIVERSARY OF IPO ON FEBRUARY 8 BY RINGING NYSE CLOSING BELL', 'text': 'NEWTOWN, PA., FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), A LEADING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION SERVICES AND PRODUCT ENGINEERING COMPANY,\xa0WILL MARK THE 10TH ANNIVERSARY OF ITS INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING (IPO) AND TRADING OF ITS SHARES ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE (NYSE) BY RINGING THE CLOSING BELL® AT 4 P.M.'}